The [[Leather Bag]] is a [[Bag]] available in the shop for all characters, at common rarity. It provides 4 backpack slots and has no other effects. In terms of the {{icon/gold}} cost to slots ratio, it is the most efficient bag in the game. Every starting class preset has at least one [[Leather Bag]] in its build.
